    {
      "id": "c-songshu-049-sunchu:received_sentence1-28",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "hx8_hzi_iq5",
      "source_quote": "高祖東征孫恩，季高義樂隨，高祖平定京邑，以為振武將軍，封新夷縣五等侯。",
      "reading": "劉裕征孫恩、定京邑，授振武，封新夷縣五等侯。",
      "note": "劉裕征孫恩、定京邑，授振武，封新夷縣五等侯。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-049-sunchu:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 28,
      "end_codepoint": 63,
      "human_reviewed": false,
      "chapter_id": "c-songshu-049-sunchu",
      "source_id": "s-songshu-049-sunchu-ws2118585"
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-049-sunchu:received_sentence1-63",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "hx8_hzi_iq5",
      "source_quote": "廣固之役，先登有功。",
      "reading": "廣固有功。",
      "note": "廣固有功。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-049-sunchu:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 63,
      "end_codepoint": 73,
      "human_reviewed": false,
      "chapter_id": "c-songshu-049-sunchu",
      "source_id": "s-songshu-049-sunchu-ws2118585"
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-049-sunchu:received_sentence2-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "hx8_hzi_iq5",
      "source_quote": "盧循之難，於石頭扞柵，戍越城、查浦，破賊於新亭。",
      "reading": "盧循逼京時參守石頭諸地，破賊新亭。",
      "note": "盧循逼京時參守石頭諸地，破賊新亭。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-049-sunchu:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 24,
      "human_reviewed": false,
      "chapter_id": "c-songshu-049-sunchu",
      "source_id": "s-songshu-049-sunchu-ws2118585"
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-049-sunchu:received_sentence2-24",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "hx8_hzi_iq5",
      "source_quote": "高祖謂季高曰：「此賊行破。",
      "reading": "劉裕告孫處，此賊將敗。",
      "note": "劉裕告孫處，此賊將敗。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-049-sunchu:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 24,
      "end_codepoint": 37,
      "human_reviewed": false,
      "chapter_id": "c-songshu-049-sunchu",
      "source_id": "s-songshu-049-sunchu-ws2118585"
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-049-sunchu:received_sentence2-37",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "hx8_hzi_iq5",
      "source_quote": "應先傾其巢窟，令奔走之日，無所歸投，非卿莫能濟事。」",
      "reading": "諭其先取番禺。",
      "note": "諭其先取番禺。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-049-sunchu:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 37,
      "end_codepoint": 63,
      "human_reviewed": false,
      "chapter_id": "c-songshu-049-sunchu",
      "source_id": "s-songshu-049-sunchu-ws2118585"
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-049-sunchu:received_sentence2-63",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "hx8_hzi_iq5",
      "source_quote": "遣季高率眾三千，汎海襲番禺。",
      "reading": "遣季高率三千由海路赴番禺。",
      "note": "遣季高率三千由海路赴番禺。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-049-sunchu:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 63,
      "end_codepoint": 77,
      "human_reviewed": false,
      "chapter_id": "c-songshu-049-sunchu",
      "source_id": "s-songshu-049-sunchu-ws2118585"
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-049-sunchu:received_sentence2-77",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "hx8_hzi_iq5",
      "source_quote": "初，賊不以海道為防，季高至東衝，去城十餘里，城內猶未知。",
      "reading": "季高到東衝，城內尚未知。",
      "note": "季高到東衝，城內尚未知。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-049-sunchu:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 77,
      "end_codepoint": 105,
      "human_reviewed": false,
      "chapter_id": "c-songshu-049-sunchu",
      "source_id": "s-songshu-049-sunchu-ws2118585"
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-049-sunchu:received_sentence2-105",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "hx8_hzi_iq5",
      "source_quote": "循守戰士猶有數千人，城池甚固。",
      "reading": "循的守兵仍多。",
      "note": "循的守兵仍多。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-049-sunchu:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 105,
      "end_codepoint": 120,
      "human_reviewed": false,
      "chapter_id": "c-songshu-049-sunchu",
      "source_id": "s-songshu-049-sunchu-ws2118585"
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-049-sunchu:received_sentence2-120",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "hx8_hzi_iq5",
      "source_quote": "季高先焚舟艦，悉力登岸，會天大霧，四面陵城，即日克拔。",
      "reading": "孫處乘霧取城。",
      "note": "孫處乘霧取城。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-049-sunchu:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 120,
      "end_codepoint": 147,
      "human_reviewed": false,
      "chapter_id": "c-songshu-049-sunchu",
      "source_id": "s-songshu-049-sunchu-ws2118585"
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-049-sunchu:received_sentence2-147",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "hx8_hzi_iq5",
      "source_quote": "循父嘏、長史孫建之、司馬虞尫夫等，輕舟奔始興。",
      "reading": "循父嘏、長史孫建之、司馬虞尫夫奔始興。",
      "note": "循父嘏、長史孫建之、司馬虞尫夫奔始興。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-049-sunchu:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 147,
      "end_codepoint": 170,
      "human_reviewed": false,
      "chapter_id": "c-songshu-049-sunchu",
      "source_id": "s-songshu-049-sunchu-ws2118585"
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-049-sunchu:received_sentence2-170",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "hx8_hzi_iq5",
      "source_quote": "即分遣振武將軍沈田子等討平始興、南康、臨賀、始安嶺表諸郡。",
      "reading": "沈田子等分平嶺表。",
      "note": "沈田子等分平嶺表。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-049-sunchu:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 170,
      "end_codepoint": 199,
      "human_reviewed": false,
      "chapter_id": "c-songshu-049-sunchu",
      "source_id": "s-songshu-049-sunchu-ws2118585"
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-049-sunchu:received_sentence2-199",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "hx8_hzi_iq5",
      "source_quote": "循於左里奔走，而眾力猶盛，自嶺道還襲廣州。",
      "reading": "盧循敗自左里返襲廣州。",
      "note": "盧循敗自左里返襲廣州。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-049-sunchu:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 199,
      "end_codepoint": 220,
      "human_reviewed": false,
      "chapter_id": "c-songshu-049-sunchu",
      "source_id": "s-songshu-049-sunchu-ws2118585"
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-049-sunchu:received_sentence2-220",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "hx8_hzi_iq5",
      "source_quote": "季高距戰二十餘日，循乃破走，所殺萬餘人，追奔至鬱林，會病，不得窮討，循遂得走向交州。",
      "reading": "季高拒之，循走；孫處至鬱林得病停追。",
      "note": "季高拒之，循走；孫處至鬱林得病停追。",
